    (
        id: 101,
        name: "Apprentice Zara Recruitment",
        root_node: 1,
        nodes: {
            1: (
                id: 1,
                text: "*she is sitting cross-legged on a stump, writing very fast in a notebook while her staff glows faintly beside her. She startles as you approach.* Oh! Actual travelers — not kobolds! Wonderful. I am Zara Brightspark, apprentice of the Mage\'s Guild. Well. Currently-separated-from-her-mentor apprentice, technically. I have been documenting everything I can find while I work out how to locate Master Elian. Are you heading somewhere useful? Or at least somewhere that is not these ruins?",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join our company, Zara.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Tell us about your mentor.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Not today. Good luck.",
                        target_node: Some(5),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            2: (
                id: 2,
                text: "Master Elian — a battle-mage of considerable experience who thought field training would do me good. He was right. We were separated during an experiment I was calling a Living Constellation — the resulting burst of Lumina energy was magnificent, if somewhat wider than intended — and the Guild believes I am lost. I am not lost. I am conducting unscheduled independent research.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join us, Zara. We can search for him together.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell. Good luck with your research.",
                        target_node: Some(5),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            3: (
                id: 3,
                text: "*immediately snaps the notebook shut and springs up* Yes! I mean — I have considered your offer carefully. A company moving with purpose is far more likely to generate interesting data than a stump in a ruin. And if my path crosses Master Elian\'s, I want to have things worth reporting. Lead on.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join the party now.",
                        target_node: Some(6),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            RecruitToParty(
                                character_id: "apprentice_zara",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Meet us at the inn.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            TriggerEvent(
                                event_name: "recruit_character_to_inn",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            4: (
                id: 4,
                text: "The inn — good. I will secure my notes and meet you there. Do NOT let anyone touch my staff in the meantime.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            5: (
                id: 5,
                text: "Understood. These ruins will keep me company. They are very old and have excellent structural documentation. Probably.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            6: (
                id: 6,
                text: "Excellent! I am ready to join your adventure. And I promise the Lumina experiments will be contained to a reasonable radius this time.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
        },
        speaker_name: Some("Apprentice Zara"),
        repeatable: false,
        associated_quest: None,
        sdk_metadata: (
            managed_content: [],
        ),
    ),
    (
        id: 102,
        name: "Whisper Recruitment",
        root_node: 1,
        nodes: {
            1: (
                id: 1,
                text: "*you notice her only because she allows it — she was watching from a doorway\'s shadow for some time before she stepped forward* Vespera Moonshadow. Some know me as Whisper. I am, professionally, a locksmith — and before you form a more colorful impression, that is precisely what I said. I also have a general aptitude for doors, windows, and situations that require more delicacy than a sword. I have been watching your company. You move with purpose. That is either very good or very bad, and I have not decided which yet.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join our company, Whisper.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "What do you want from us?",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Tell us about yourself.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            2: (
                id: 2,
                text: "*a brief, evaluating pause, then a nod* Acceptable. I should warn you: I have certain professional habits that occasionally startle people. Nothing actionable — I simply notice things. Lead on.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join the party now.",
                        target_node: Some(6),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            RecruitToParty(
                                character_id: "whisper",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Meet us at the inn.",
                        target_node: Some(5),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            TriggerEvent(
                                event_name: "recruit_character_to_inn",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            3: (
                id: 3,
                text: "Not to go back to where I came from. Not to find out the hard way that I misjudged your purpose. Beyond that, I am adaptable. A locksmith who travels with a company that picks worthwhile fights — that is a more interesting life than one who does not. What is the worst that could happen?",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join us, then.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            4: (
                id: 4,
                text: "Silver Spires, High Elf court, the kind of life where everything is beautiful and absolutely nothing is interesting. I traded it for a considerably less beautiful but more interesting alternative. *shrugs* The court has not missed me. I have not missed the court.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "We could use that experience. Join us.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell, Whisper.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            5: (
                id: 5,
                text: "The inn. Fine. I will take a room and watch the exits. Standard practice.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            6: (
                id: 6,
                text: "*a half-smile* Your loss is not necessarily my loss. I know which way the interesting road goes.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
        },
        speaker_name: Some("Whisper"),
        repeatable: false,
        associated_quest: None,
        sdk_metadata: (
            managed_content: [],
        ),
    ),
    (
