    (
        id: 104,
        name: "Kira Valerius - The Exile Knight",
        root_node: 1,
        nodes: {
            1: (
                id: 1,
                text: "*she stands in the town square, arms crossed, studying each face that passes with the practiced eye of someone who has been assembling a company one careful decision at a time* I am Kira Valerius. Former knight of Eldoria — what remains of it. I have been building a company here for several weeks. Decent coin, reasonable danger, genuine purpose. You look like you are either here to join or here to take stock of the competition. Either way, I would like to know which.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "We are looking for a company to join.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Tell us about Eldoria.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "We lead our own company.",
                        target_node: Some(5),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            2: (
                id: 2,
                text: "Eldoria was a kingdom on the far coast — art, chivalry, and walls that held for centuries. Then the Void-Blight arrived. A creeping corruption that drained the color from everything it touched and turned heroes into husks. I led the survivors out. *a pause, controlled, not entirely without weight* One day I intend to lead them back. That requires strength I do not yet have. So I build it here.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join our company, Kira.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "A heavy burden to carry.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            3: (
                id: 3,
                text: "*a measured nod, something settling into focus in her expression* Good. I do not make that offer to everyone. I expect honest fighting, honest counsel, and the understanding that we protect the people who cannot protect themselves. Everything else is negotiable. We move when you say.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join the party now.",
                        target_node: Some(6),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            RecruitToParty(
                                character_id: "tutorial_human_knight",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Meet us at the inn.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            TriggerEvent(
                                event_name: "recruit_character_to_inn",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "We need more time.",
                        target_node: Some(7),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            4: (
                id: 4,
                text: "The inn — I know the innkeeper. Good establishment. I will see you there.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            5: (
                id: 5,
                text: "Then you lead and I will consider whether your leadership is worth following. *a half-smile* That is how I assemble a company — one careful look at a time. The offer stands either way.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "We would welcome your company.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell, then.",
                        target_node: Some(7),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            6: (
                id: 6,
                text: "Then we march. I will carry my own weight — and then some — and I expect the same of everyone beside me. The road will not be easy, but it is worth walking.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            7: (
                id: 7,
                text: "Fair enough. The road has plenty of capable people on it. If you change your mind, I will be here.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
        },
        speaker_name: Some("Kira"),
        repeatable: false,
        associated_quest: None,
        sdk_metadata: (
            managed_content: [],
        ),
    ),
    (
        id: 105,
        name: "Sirius Xylanthir - The Void-Weave Master",
        root_node: 1,
        nodes: {
            1: (
                id: 1,
                text: "*he does not look up from the spell he is inscribing in the air — a lattice of violet light that he adjusts with two fingers, dissatisfied, then disperses entirely* This region has remarkably little arcane interference. Either nothing dangerous lives here or everything dangerous is somewhere else. *finally regards you* Sirius Xylanthir. Sorcerer. You have the look of people heading toward the second possibility. That is the more interesting direction.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join our company.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "What are you looking for?",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Tell us about yourself.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            2: (
                id: 2,
                text: "*the ghost of something that is almost enthusiasm* Then we have an agreement. I will carry my own weight and then some, provided you point me at something worth the expenditure of power. Do not apologize if I am thorough.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join the party now.",
                        target_node: Some(6),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            RecruitToParty(
                                character_id: "tutorial_elf_sorcerer",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Meet us at the inn.",
                        target_node: Some(5),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            TriggerEvent(
                                event_name: "recruit_character_to_inn",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            3: (
                id: 3,
                text: "Something worth the effort of a real duel. Something that does not simply fall over the moment I begin casting. The elven war-colleges trained me to be careful, methodical, slow. I am none of those things and I find their opinion increasingly irrelevant. A company with genuine enemies — that is useful to me. Are yours genuine?",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Very genuine. Join us.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Join us and find out.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            4: (
                id: 4,
                text: "Dark Elf. Centuries in the subterranean reaches studying the Void-Weave — sorcery that draws from the spaces between stars and the silence of the deep. My peers thought mastery of the arcane was an end in itself. I found it was only interesting as a tool for dealing with things that could not simply be walked around. I came to the surface in search of those things.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "We have those things. Join us.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            5: (
                id: 5,
                text: "The inn. Adequate. I will be there when you have need of me — which will be sooner than you think.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            6: (
                id: 6,
                text: "Good. Try to keep up.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
        },
        speaker_name: Some("Sirius"),
        repeatable: false,
        associated_quest: None,
        sdk_metadata: (
            managed_content: [],
        ),
    ),
    (
        id: 106,
        name: "Mira - The Radiant Sentinel",
        root_node: 1,
        nodes: {
            1: (
                id: 1,
                text: "*she kneels beside a traveler whose wound she has finished binding, then straightens, staff in hand* There. *to you, quietly* I am Mira. I serve with the Order of the Resplendent Dawn — or I did, before I understood that the people who need healing most are not the ones who come to the temple door. They are on the roads, in the ruins, in the dark places where the light has not reached yet. I go where the wounds are.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join our company, Mira.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Tell us about your order.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "The road is dangerous.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell, Mira.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            2: (
                id: 2,
                text: "The Order of the Resplendent Dawn tends the light that holds against the Great Gloom — a suffocating darkness that has been spreading from the edges of the world for as long as I can remember. I grew up in a village that stood as a lonely outpost against it. I know what the light costs and what it is worth. I know the shadows are not finished growing.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Then come with us. The shadows we face are very real.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            3: (
                id: 3,
                text: "Then I will come. I do not ask for comfort and I will not make false promises — only honest work and every healing prayer I have. Let us go. The Gloom does not rest and neither should we.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join the party now.",
                        target_node: Some(6),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            RecruitToParty(
                                character_id: "tutorial_human_cleric",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Meet us at the inn.",
                        target_node: Some(5),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            TriggerEvent(
                                event_name: "recruit_character_to_inn",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            4: (
                id: 4,
                text: "*regards the road ahead with the steady calm of someone who has thought this through* I am aware. I was already in danger before you found me. What I need is a company with a purpose worth traveling toward, not just from.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "We have that purpose. Join us.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            5: (
                id: 5,
                text: "The inn — yes. I will be ready when you are. I never pack lightly.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            6: (
                id: 6,
                text: "I am glad. Wounds find their way to me wherever I am — better to meet them on a path worth walking.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
        },
        speaker_name: Some("Mira"),
        repeatable: false,
        associated_quest: None,
        sdk_metadata: (
            managed_content: [],
        ),
    ),
    (
        id: 107,
        name: "Old Gareth - The Last Pillar",
        root_node: 1,
        nodes: {
            1: (
                id: 1,
                text: "*he does not look up from the blade he is working on, hammer ringing in a measured rhythm against the anvil* Aye. I know why you are here. Someone told you an old dwarf with a shield and a bad back might be worth asking. *sets the hammer down, finally looks at you* I am Old Gareth Deepstone. Last Pillar of Aethelgard. Former High Protector of a city that no longer exists because I was not everywhere at once when it mattered. So I run a smithy now and pretend the fighting days are behind me. They are not quite as behind me as I pretend.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join our company, Gareth.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Tell us about Aethelgard.",
                        target_node: Some(2),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "The cause is worthy of the Last Pillar.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            2: (
                id: 2,
                text: "A city carved into the heart of the Ironpeak Mountains. The finest stonework in the world, or so we believed. Then the Great Tremor came — not accident, not nature, a wound in the world\'s fabric that split the range open and brought the mountain down on top of us. I anchored the main dome long enough for the people to run. *a long pause* The dome did not hold indefinitely.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "You saved your people.",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "What do you carry now?",
                        target_node: Some(3),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            3: (
                id: 3,
                text: "*something heavy and deliberate in the words* The Core Shield. Forged from the center of the shattered mountain — the piece that was already stone before the rest fell. As long as I carry it, something of Aethelgard still stands. *he picks up the shield, its surface bearing a fracture pattern like a memory* I do not carry it for sentiment. I carry it because the people who died there deserve to have someone still paying attention.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "That is a worthy cause. Join ours.",
                        target_node: Some(4),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Farewell, Gareth.",
                        target_node: None,
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            4: (
                id: 4,
                text: "*a long, measuring look, the kind that has sized up enemies for two hundred years* One condition. We are not here for glory, or gold, or stories to tell in warm taverns. We are here because someone needs a wall between them and the dark. *picks up the shield* Right. I will get my axe.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [
                    (
                        text: "Join the party now.",
                        target_node: Some(6),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            RecruitToParty(
                                character_id: "old_gareth",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "Meet us at the inn.",
                        target_node: Some(5),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [
                            TriggerEvent(
                                event_name: "recruit_character_to_inn",
                            ),
                        ],
                        ends_dialogue: false,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                    (
                        text: "We need more time.",
                        target_node: Some(7),
                        conditions: [],
                        actions: [],
                        ends_dialogue: true,
                        sdk_metadata: (
                            managed_content: [],
                        ),
                    ),
                ],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: false,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            5: (
                id: 5,
                text: "The inn. *a grunt that might be approval* I will be there. Do not order the mutton stew.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            6: (
                id: 6,
                text: "Right. *shoulders the Core Shield* Let us see if this cause is worth carrying.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
            7: (
                id: 7,
                text: "Right. *picks up the hammer* If the cause changes shape and becomes worth the trouble, you know where I am.",
                speaker_override: None,
                choices: [],
                conditions: [],
                actions: [],
                is_terminal: true,
                sdk_metadata: (
                    managed_content: [],
                ),
            ),
        },
        speaker_name: Some("Old Gareth"),
        repeatable: false,
        associated_quest: None,
        sdk_metadata: (
            managed_content: [],
        ),
    ),
